      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "To change the appearance of the pointer when it hovers over the button, create a [`UIButton.PointerStyleProvider`](uibutton/pointerstyleprovider-swift.typealias.md) closure that returns a [`UIPointerStyle`](uipointerstyle.md) describing the pointer shape and content effect.",
      "normalizedSource": "To change the appearance of the pointer when it hovers over the button, create a [`UIButton.PointerStyleProvider`](uibutton/pointerstyleprovider-swift.typealias.md) closure that returns a [`UIPointerStyle`](uipointerstyle.md) describing the pointer shape and content effect.",
