    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "For example, the following code listing creates a pointer style that applies a lift effect to the button when the pointer hovers over it.",
      "normalizedSource": "For example, the following code listing creates a pointer style that applies a lift effect to the button when the pointer hovers over it.",
      "sourceHash": "f01ec41d0e3d1b36cf2b4a0d3a83fa4ea393731db6a38efe6c08403c42ad7573",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Then assign the closure to [`pointerStyleProvider`](uibutton/pointerstyleprovider-y4eb.md).",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nthreadColorButton.pointerStyleProvider = { button, proposedEffect, proposedShape -> UIPointerStyle? in\n    let cornerRadius: CGFloat = 4\n    let parameters = UIPreviewParameters()\n    let shapePath = UIBezierPath(roundedRect: button.bounds, cornerRadius: cornerRadius)\n    parameters.shadowPath = shapePath\n    let preview = UITargetedPreview(view: proposedEffect.preview.view, parameters: parameters, target: proposedEffect.preview.target)\n    \n    let rect = button.convert(button.bounds, to: preview.target.container)\n    return UIPointerStyle(effect: .lift(preview), shape: .roundedRect(rect, radius: cornerRadius))\n}\n```",
      "documentTitle": "pointerStyleProvider",
      "framework": "UIKit",
